WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.929 --> 00:00:11.730
Hey youtubers it’s charlie, since we’ve
all had a chance to process the walking dead

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.889
midseason finale I thought it was time to
start talking about wtf is going to happen

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:16.689
in the second half of the season.

00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:19.730
Aside from everyone dying horribly game of
thrones style.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:23.300
This video will be my top 10 predictions for
the second half of the season.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.730
Since it won’t be back for about 8 more
weeks I’ll be doing weekly bonus videos.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.200
Be sure to subscribe to get them.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.340
And let me know in the comments what you want
to talk about most.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.940
So in the name of sweet baby judith let’s
get this walker part started

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.989
Number 10 - Direct Comic Book Adaptations.

00:00:37.989 --> 00:00:43.140
Robert Kirkman said that the mid-season premiere
in february will be the most faithful adaptation

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.370
of the comic book story.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:48.260
If you have read the story following the governor’s
death try not to spoil it too much in the

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:49.260
comments.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:52.560
The story will pick up right where it left
off just like last year.

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.120
Number 9 - The fate of baby judith.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.260
I saw an overwhelming amount of comments about
judth being dead, but if you look closely

00:00:58.260 --> 00:00:59.380
at her bloody carseat it is unbuckled.

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:00.770
And walkers would have just eaten her out.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:02.150
This means she’s definitely alive, but of
all the people who could have grabbed her,

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:05.080
it’s most likely that tyreese and Lizzie’s
group took her and ran into the woods.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.970
I almost feel like it would have been unforgivable
to have killed judith in episode 8.

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:15.780
But let me know yes or no if you would have
quit the show if they definitely killed her.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:17.390
Number 8 - Sheriff Carl.

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:19.994
When I say sheriff carl what I mean is that
Carl not only gets more scenes, he also becomes

00:01:19.994 --> 00:01:20.994
more of a leader.

00:01:20.994 --> 00:01:23.220
And it’s mostly out of necessity.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.230
If you just watch Rick during the last half
of episode 8 you’re forced to just watch

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.560
him slowly die inside.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:34.110
In the teaser for episode 9 you can even see
that he’s gotten the shit kicked out of

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:39.760
him emotionally and physically so much that
Carl basically has to take care of him.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:40.760
Number 7 - New Characters.

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:45.869
some new characters from the comic books that
we’ve already seen casting calls for are

00:01:45.869 --> 00:01:46.869
Eugene, Rosita and Abraham.

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:48.150
Most of them won’t arrive until episode
10.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.579
in the comics they were introduced back on
hershel’s farm, but remember it got burned

00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:57.150
down in season 2, so the people that escaped
from the prison will meet them en route to

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.150
Washington DC.

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:03.680
The cool thing is that Abraham’s group will
get a full backstory in their own episode,

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.640
just like the governor got his own episode
to explain where he’d been.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.209
Number 6 - New Splinter Groups.

00:02:08.209 --> 00:02:13.540
There will be several separate storylines
featuring different groups with members from

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.099
the governor’s camp and the prison.

00:02:16.099 --> 00:02:22.470
There were a lot of good people living with
the governor like Lilly and Tara that will

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.180
now be traveling with people from the prison.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:27.290
We don’t know who will mix into which groups,
but remember right now there’s the group

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.609
that escaped on the bus and at least two different
groups that escaped into the woods on foot.

00:02:30.609 --> 00:02:32.870
One was Tyreese and the girls and the other
was led by Rick and Carl.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:36.790
It would be fairly poetic if Lilly and tara
ended up with Rick’s group.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.510
Number 5 - The return of Morgan.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:51.269
Scott Gimple said that Morgan would be coming
back and in the comics Rick and Abraham run

00:02:51.269 --> 00:02:58.749
into him back in Rick’s hometown on their
way to washington DC.

00:02:58.749 --> 00:02:59.859
Number 4 - The return of carol.

00:02:59.859 --> 00:03:04.780
It took morgan almost two seasons to come
back after he split from Rick, but TVGuide

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:09.519
was reporting that she’d rejoin Daryl’s
group before the end of the season.

00:03:09.519 --> 00:03:12.760
So it’s unlikely that we’ll see her right
away when the show comes back.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:15.059
Number 3 - New Unknown character named Gareth.

00:03:15.059 --> 00:03:20.840
He’ll be an amalgam of some unknown characters
from the comics but Hollywood reporter was

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:22.870
saying he’d play a big role in season 4.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:28.059
The best guesses right now is that he either
has something to do with the Alexandria Safe-Zone

00:03:28.059 --> 00:03:31.260
and Abraham’s group or he’s a version
of Chris, the leader of the hunters.

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.439
Number 2 - The hunters are coming.

00:03:32.439 --> 00:03:33.439
The cannibals are just around the corner.

00:03:33.439 --> 00:03:37.059
It’s unclear whether or not they’ll just
be teased or if we’ll actually see them

00:03:37.059 --> 00:03:38.059
this season.

00:03:38.059 --> 00:03:39.839
In the comics they battle with Rick’s group
while they’re on their way to washington

00:03:39.839 --> 00:03:41.279
DC.

00:03:41.279 --> 00:03:44.739
So meeting them will largely depend on how
far Rick’s group travels before the season

00:03:44.739 --> 00:03:46.109
finale.

00:03:46.109 --> 00:03:52.349
and my number 1 thing to look forward to - The
Sanctuary and The Alexandria Safe Zone.

00:03:52.349 --> 00:03:56.400
Remember the radio message Daryl’s group
heard before they had to abandon the charger.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:04.089
A lot of you guys have predicted that we’ll
go back to the alexandria safe zone, so it

00:04:04.089 --> 00:04:05.669
could have been from there.

00:04:05.669 --> 00:04:07.879
Or it could just be a trap.

00:04:07.879 --> 00:04:11.469
There are some new villains from the comics
that we haven’t met yet not including the

00:04:11.469 --> 00:04:12.469
hunters.

00:04:12.469 --> 00:04:16.470
I don’t want to spoil it too much for anyone
that hasn’t read the comics, but it seems

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:17.769
too early in the story to meet them.

00:04:17.769 --> 00:04:22.840
Let me know what you’re most excited to
see when walking dead comes back and do you

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.290
think we’ll meet the hunters this season?

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:27.430
Like I said, I’ll be doing bonus walking
dead videos for the next 8 weeks.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:28.560
Be sure to subscribe to get them.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:31.560
And be sure to let me know what kind of videos
you want me to do.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:36.479
Right now click here to watch my mid-season
finale video and click here to for my videos

00:04:36.479 --> 00:04:38.300
for the rest of season 4.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.270
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow,
high fives!

